{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ULA7pJH93a1793273182.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>FIBA國際籃球聯會，3x3世界巡迴賽香港大師賽，下月尾維園舉行。</p><p></p><p>今屆由灣仔會展回歸維園，16隊角逐，包括蒙古烏蘭巴托、美國普林斯頓、中國杭州隊及主場Team Hong Kong，總獎金超過100萬港元。</p><p></p><p>主隊繼續有奧運金牌成員，拉脫維亞名將查維斯壓陣，甲一永倫的徐遠成亦加入，還有港青前代表吳晉寧等，為響應政府「票尾經濟」，觀眾憑賽事票尾，可享用嘉年華優惠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:52.997576+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:58:08.317386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:22.860022+00:00","content_hash":"ded31bb9bfa5addfade01d987a2adf5a0165efcd33e2e14e05c7f5f87feb8cde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:52.997576+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}